{"completed": true, "response": "一阵晶莹的音符从高处轻轻洒落，像晨雾里忽然飘起的细雨，清澈、细密，几乎没有重量。水波仍在缓缓流动，却不再催促着什么。先前那股不断向前的力量仿佛渐渐退远，留下宽松而透明的空气。旋律自由地舒展，时而闪烁，时而飘散，仿佛连呼吸也变得轻了。这里有一种难得的安静，却不是彻底的平静。那些曾经热切涌动的情感并未消失，只是暂时失去了逼近的力量。人在这一瞬间仿佛清醒过来，能够稍稍离开自己的渴望，安静地望着它。它依然美得令人心动，却也显出一丝难以言说的疲惫与脆弱。短暂的明亮中，既有松开的舒畅，也有隐约的惆怅，仿佛终于可以不急于抵达，只让这一点澄澈的光停留片刻。", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-642ec10e74944266a769c19f12cff2e5", "response_sha256": "6f860645a92e17e94cc8bf0d815a1badb0f3a491c769e719d89e930dec920160", "session_handle": "d5ec631b-93a2-4176-b91c-a1586c894ae7", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.912, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.885}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 78, "first_assistant_seconds": 0.047, "first_text_seconds": 0.188, "stream_seconds": 9.766, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 71}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observations": [], "reasoning_observat